      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors recommend a multidisciplinary approach for the diagnosis and treatment of facial pain. With this approach, several experts can accurately diagnose various disorders of facial pain and offer appropriate treatment options, which should be tailored to the specific needs and general condition of the patient. For reporting and comparison, seek standardization of methods of analysis and outcomes criteria. Associate with a good secretary and nurse. For your patients' benefit, be an optimistic, caring, and attentive listener."},
